## OSI Model (7 Layers)

> Mnemonic (7→1): **A**ll **P**eople **S**eem **T**o **N**eed **D**ata **P**rocessing

| # | Layer | What it does | Examples | Attack Surface |
|---|-------|-------------|----------|----------------|
| 7 | **Application** | User-facing protocols | HTTP, DNS, SMTP | XSS, SQLi |
| 6 | **Presentation** | Encoding, encryption, compression | TLS, SSL, JPEG | SSL stripping |
| 5 | **Session** | Opens/manages sessions | NetBIOS, RPC | Session hijacking |
| 4 | **Transport** | End-to-end delivery, ports | TCP, UDP | Port scan, DoS |
| 3 | **Network** | IP routing between networks | IP, ICMP, IPSec | IP spoofing |
| 2 | **Data Link** | Frame transfer on same link | Ethernet, MAC | ARP spoofing |
| 1 | **Physical** | Raw bits over cables/air | Wi-Fi, Ethernet | Tap, jamming |

