## Essential CLI Tools

```bash
# Network scanning
nmap -sS -sV 192.168.1.0/24        # SYN scan + service version detection
nmap -A -T4 <target>               # Aggressive scan (OS, version, scripts)

# Traffic capture
tcpdump -i eth0 -w capture.pcap    # Capture traffic to file
wireshark                          # GUI packet analysis

# Open ports / listening services
netstat -tulnp                     # Listening ports + processes (older)
ss -tulnp                          # Modern replacement for netstat

# DNS
dig google.com ANY                 # All DNS record types
dig axfr @ns1.target.com target.com  # Zone transfer attempt
nslookup target.com                # Basic DNS lookup

# Routing / path
traceroute target.com              # Linux hop-by-hop path
tracert target.com                 # Windows equivalent
arp -a                             # Show ARP table

# HTTP inspection
curl -v https://site.com           # Verbose request + response headers
curl -I https://site.com           # Headers only
```

